{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function createEffect<TRow, TKey>(config): Effect;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/effect.ts#L200","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/query/effect.ts:200"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a reactive effect that fires handlers when rows enter, exit, or\nupdate within a query result. Effects process deltas only — they do not\nmaintain or require the full materialised query result."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"trow","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TRow"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TRow"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Record"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tkey","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TKey"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"config","children":[{"type":"text","value":"config"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/EffectConfig.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"EffectConfig"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TRow"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TKey"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/Effect.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Effect"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const effect = createEffect({\n  query: (q) => q.from({ msg: messagesCollection })\n    .where(({ msg }) => eq(msg.role, 'user')),\n  onEnter: async (event) => {\n    await generateResponse(event.value)\n  },\n})\n\n// Later: stop the effect\nawait effect.dispose()","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"trow","text":"TRow","level":3},{"id":"tkey","text":"TKey","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"config","text":"config","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction createEffect<TRow, TKey>(config): Effect;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/effect.ts:200](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/effect.ts#L200)\n\nCreates a reactive effect that fires handlers when rows enter, exit, or\nupdate within a query result. Effects process deltas only — they do not\nmaintain or require the full materialised query result.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TRow\n\n`TRow` *extends* `object` = `Record`\\<`string`, `unknown`\\>\n\n### TKey\n\n`TKey` *extends* `string` \\| `number` = `string` \\| `number`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### config\n\n[`EffectConfig`](../interfaces/EffectConfig.md)\\<`TRow`, `TKey`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n[`Effect`](../interfaces/Effect.md)\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst effect = createEffect({\n  query: (q) => q.from({ msg: messagesCollection })\n    .where(({ msg }) => eq(msg.role, 'user')),\n  onEnter: async (event) => {\n    await generateResponse(event.value)\n  },\n})\n\n// Later: stop the effect\nawait effect.dispose()\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: createEffect\ntitle: createEffect\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction createEffect<TRow, TKey>(config): Effect;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/effect.ts:200](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/effect.ts#L200)\n\nCreates a reactive effect that fires handlers when rows enter, exit, or\nupdate within a query result. Effects process deltas only — they do not\nmaintain or require the full materialised query result.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TRow\n\n`TRow` *extends* `object` = `Record`\\<`string`, `unknown`\\>\n\n### TKey\n\n`TKey` *extends* `string` \\| `number` = `string` \\| `number`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### config\n\n[`EffectConfig`](../interfaces/EffectConfig.md)\\<`TRow`, `TKey`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n[`Effect`](../interfaces/Effect.md)\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst effect = createEffect({\n  query: (q) => q.from({ msg: messagesCollection })\n    .where(({ msg }) => eq(msg.role, 'user')),\n  onEnter: async (event) => {\n    await generateResponse(event.value)\n  },\n})\n\n// Later: stop the effect\nawait effect.dispose()\n```\n"}
